Biggest Improvement I Would Suggest 

Currently you are thinking:

What command runs next?


Start thinking:

Why is this stage needed?


Example:

checkout


Don't think:

Checkout command runs

Think:

Terraform code must exist on runner.

terraform init


Don't think:

Init command runs

Think:

Providers and backend must be downloaded before Terraform can work.

azure login


Don't think:

Login command runs

Think:

Runner needs Azure credentials before it can create resources.

